OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThree Iran-backed suspects plotted
OL,4,Aattacks including RAF Fairford
OL,5,Aincident, US says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne man, a dual Iranian-Iraqi national,
OL,8,Fis accused of communicating with
OL,9,Fcontacts in the UK from a prison in New
OL,10,FYork where he is awaiting trial on
OL,11,Fprevious charges. The other two are
OL,12,Faccused of doing the same from Iran.
OL,14,FIran has strongly denied any
OL,15,Finvolvement in the RAF Fairford
OL,16,Fincident, which came to light when
OL,17,Fsuspicious vans were reported near the
OL,18,Fbase. Seven men have been arrested in
OL,19,Fthe UK over the incident.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
